        "original_id": "b1fa247f-7838-51ba-afad-e61ecbe4751f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Landing Barge, Kitchen\n- Events: Normandy landings, Operation Neptune, Operation Overlord\n- Concepts: D-Day, Allied invasion of Normandy, galley facilities\n\nFacts:\n- On Tuesday, 6 June 1944, the Normandy landings, codenamed Operation Neptune, were the landing operations of the Allied invasion of Normandy during Operation Overlord in World War II.\n- D-Day was the term used for 6 June 1944, the date of the Normandy landings.\n- The Landing Barge, Kitchen was primarily intended to provide hot meals to the crews of many minor landing craft that lacked galley facilities.",
